// Example 5: Multimedia Integration
// Demonstrating Sprint 3 features: images, audio, video, scenes, characters

=== start ===

@scene bg="title_screen.jpg" music="main_theme.mp3"

THE LAST JOURNEY

A visual novel demo

@audio play="click.mp3"

* [Begin] -> chapter1

=== chapter1 ===

@scene bg="forest_morning.jpg" music="peaceful_forest.mp3"

Chapter 1: The Forest

You awaken in a sunlit forest clearing.

@image show="protagonist_wakeup.png" duration=2 fade=true

Birds chirp overhead. The air smells of pine and morning dew.

* [Stand up] -> stand_up
* [Look around] -> look_around

=== stand_up ===

@audio play="rustle.mp3"

You rise to your feet, brushing leaves from your clothes.

@image show="protagonist_standing.png" fade=true

* [Continue] -> meet_stranger

=== look_around ===

@audio play="ambient_wind.mp3" loop=true volume=0.3

You scan your surroundings carefully.

@image show="forest_panorama.jpg" duration=3

The forest stretches endlessly in all directions.

* [Stand up] -> stand_up

=== meet_stranger ===

@scene bg="forest_path.jpg"
@audio stop="peaceful_forest.mp3"
@audio play="mysterious_theme.mp3" fade=true

A figure emerges from the trees.

@char name="Stranger" portrait="stranger_neutral.png"

"You're finally awake," they say.

* [Who are you?] -> ask_identity
* [Where am I?] -> ask_location

=== ask_identity ===

@char name="Stranger" portrait="stranger_smile.png"

"I am known by many names. But you may call me Guide."

* [Where am I?] -> ask_location

=== ask_location ===

@char name="Stranger" portrait="stranger_serious.png"

"You are at the crossroads between worlds."

@audio play="dramatic_sting.mp3"

"The path you choose here will determine everything."

* [Show me the paths] -> show_paths

=== show_paths ===

@scene bg="crossroads.jpg" music="epic_theme.mp3"

You follow the Guide to a fork in the road.

@image show="two_paths.png"

@char name="Guide" portrait="stranger_neutral.png"

"Choose wisely, traveler."

* [Take the light path] -> light_path
* [Take the dark path] -> dark_path

=== light_path ===

@scene bg="sunny_meadow.jpg" music="uplifting_theme.mp3"

@audio play="birds_chirping.mp3" loop=true volume=0.4

You walk into brilliant sunlight.

@image show="meadow_flowers.jpg" duration=3 fade=true

The path ahead is clear and bright.

@char name="Guide" portrait="stranger_smile.png"

"A brave choice. May your journey be filled with hope."

-> ending_good

=== dark_path ===

@scene bg="dark_forest.jpg" music="ominous_theme.mp3"

@audio play="thunder.mp3"

Storm clouds gather as you venture into shadow.

@image show="lightning_flash.png" duration=1

@char name="Guide" portrait="stranger_serious.png"

"So be it. Face what lies ahead with courage."

-> ending_uncertain

=== ending_good ===

@scene bg="sunrise.jpg" music="triumphant_theme.mp3"

GOOD ENDING

@image show="protagonist_victorious.png" fade=true duration=3

You have chosen the path of light.

Your journey has only just begun...

@video play="credits.mp4"

-> END

=== ending_uncertain ===

@scene bg="stormy_night.jpg" music="mysterious_theme.mp3"

UNCERTAIN ENDING

@image show="protagonist_shadow.png" fade=true duration=3

You have chosen the path of shadow.

What awaits you in the darkness?

@video play="teaser.mp4"

TO BE CONTINUED...

-> END
